  "prefLabel": "Rev 1612.01 Availability of Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1612.01 Availability of Forms. Forms may be obtained by:\n\n(a) Writing to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\n109 Pleasant Street\n\nP.O. Box 637\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0637; or\n\n(b) Calling the forms line at 603-230-5001.\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1611.01); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
